---
title: "initialize (LegionSealedBidAuctionSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_validate: validate params
    q_validate --> q_check_timing: params valid
    q_validate --> q_revert_invalid: params invalid
    q_revert_invalid --> [*]: revert InvalidParameters
    q_check_timing --> q_check_key: startTime < endTime < refundEndTime
    q_check_timing --> q_revert_timing: timing violation
    q_revert_timing --> [*]: revert InvalidTiming
    q_check_key --> q_set_config: ECIES publicKey is valid
    q_check_key --> q_revert_key: invalid publicKey
    q_revert_key --> [*]: revert InvalidPublicKey
    q_set_config --> q_set_addresses: set publicKey, minimumInvestAmount, timing params
    q_set_addresses --> q_set_fees: set bidToken, askToken, projectAdmin, addressRegistry
    q_set_fees --> [*]: set legionFee, referrerFee bps values

    note right of q_check_key
        INV-001: startTime < endTime < refundEndTime
        INV-002: ECIES publicKey must be non-zero for bid encryption
        INV-003: minimumInvestAmount > 0
        INV-004: bidToken and askToken are non-zero addresses
    end note
